      "title": "Rate by hour of day",
      "description": "Incidents per 100 km driven, by the hour the drive started (UTC), so busy hours are not mistaken for risky ones.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "TeslaMate"
